# D9 / D10 Official Grant Statement templates

Update **D9** (Quarterly Community Support & Fundraising Cashback Grant Statement) and **D10** (Remittance / Payment Receipt) HTML for ATO-aligned transparency and partner audit retention.

## Settlement cadence

- Periods use **Australian financial-year quarters** (FY starts 1 July):
  - Q1 Jul–Sep · Q2 Oct–Dec · Q3 Jan–Mar · Q4 Apr–Jun
- Period id shape: `FY2025-26-Q1` (see `lib/fundraising/auFinancialQuarter.ts`)
- **Target payout date:** 15th calendar day of the month after quarter end (roll to next Monday if Sat/Sun). No minimum payout amount.
- Show period label + target payout date on D9.

## Required content

### Payment destination (especially D10; D9 may show intended payee)

- Masked BSB / account (last 4)
- Payment Date / Reference (D10)

### ABN / GST

- Formatted partner ABN or “Not Provided — ABN Withholding May Apply”
- GST-free community support note as applicable

### Audit footer

- Retain for organisation files; SELPIC retains remittance evidence per AU tax/company rules

Integrate in `buildFundraisingDocumentHtml` for D9/D10 and Sample Preview / payout Mark Paid generation paths.
